# PDF Generator

## Tổng quan

PDF Generator là skill chuyên biệt để tạo professional PDF documents từ various sources trong Cursor Enterprise Framework. Skill này hỗ trợ multiple content types (markdown, HTML, data tables, code), customizable templates, advanced layouts, và production-ready output với embedded fonts, bookmarks, và table of contents.

## Purpose (Mục đích)

Trong enterprise environments, PDF documents vẫn rất quan trọng cho:

1. **Documentation**: Official documentation cần stable, printable format
2. **Reports**: Business reports cần professional formatting
3. **Archives**: Historical records cần long-term preservation
4. **Sharing**: External sharing requires universal compatibility
5. **Print**: Quality printing requires precise layout control

PDF Generator tồn tại để:

- **Automate documentation generation** từ code và data
- **Maintain consistent styling** across all documents
- **Support complex layouts** (multi-column, mixed content)
- **Preserve formatting** across platforms
- **Enable programmatic generation** cho dynamic content

## Input (Đầu vào)

| Input | Mô tả | Required |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `content_sources` | Array của content (md, html, data) | Yes |
| `template` | Template configuration | Yes |
| `layout` | Page layout specifications | No |
| `styling` | CSS/style definitions | No |
| `output_config` | Output settings | Yes |
| `metadata` | Document metadata | No |

## Output (Đầu ra)

| Output | Mô tả | Format |
|--------|-------|--------|
| `pdf_file` | Generated PDF file | Buffer/File |
| `preview` | Preview version | HTML/Image |
| `toc` | Table of contents | TOC structure |
| `bookmarks` | Document bookmarks | Bookmark list |
| `metadata` | Document metadata | Object |

## Workflow (Quy trình)

### Bước 1: Content Parsing

```typescript
// Parse various content sources
interface ParsedContent {
  type: 'markdown' | 'html' | 'data' | 'mixed';
  sections: ContentSection[];
  metadata: ContentMetadata;
}

class ContentParser {
  private markdownParser: MarkdownParser;
  private htmlParser: HtmlParser;
  private dataParser: DataParser;
  
  async parse(source: ContentSource): Promise<ParsedContent> {
    const contentType = this.detectType(source);
    
    switch (contentType) {
      case 'markdown':
        return this.parseMarkdown(source);
      case 'html':
        return this.parseHtml(source);
      case 'data':
        return this.parseData(source);
      case 'mixed':
        return this.parseMixed(source);
      default:
        throw new UnsupportedContentType(contentType);
    }
  }
  
  private async parseMarkdown(source: MarkdownSource): Promise<ParsedContent> {
    const ast = this.markdownParser.parse(source.content);
    
    // Extract metadata
    const metadata = this.extractMarkdownMetadata(ast);
    
    // Split into sections
    const sections = this.splitIntoSections(ast, {
      splitOn: ['# ', '## ', '### '],
      includeToc: true
    });
    
    // Process code blocks
    for (const section of sections) {
      section.codeBlocks = this.extractCodeBlocks(section.content);
      section.tables = this.extractTables(section.content);
      section.images = this.extractImages(source, section.content);
    }
    
    return {
      type: 'markdown',
      sections,
      metadata
    };
  }
  
  private async parseMixed(source: MixedSource): Promise<ParsedContent> {
    const sections: ContentSection[] = [];
    
    for (const part of source.parts) {
      const parsed = await this.parse({ type: part.type, content: part.content });
      sections.push(...parsed.sections);
    }
    
    return {
      type: 'mixed',
      sections: this.mergeAdjacentSections(sections),
      metadata: this.mergeMetadata(source.parts.map(p => p.metadata))
    };
  }
}
```

### Bước 2: Template Processing

```typescript
// Process template và apply styles
interface TemplateConfig {
  name: string;
  page: PageConfig;
  typography: TypographyConfig;
  colors: ColorConfig;
  elements: ElementStyles;
}

class TemplateProcessor {
  private templates: Map<string, TemplateConfig>;
  private styleEngine: StyleEngine;
  
  constructor() {
    this.templates = this.loadBuiltInTemplates();
    this.styleEngine = new StyleEngine();
  }
  
  async process(
    content: ParsedContent,
    template: TemplateConfig | string
  ): Promise<ProcessedTemplate> {
    const resolvedTemplate = this.resolveTemplate(template);
    
    // Apply template to each section
    const processedSections = await Promise.all(
      content.sections.map(section => 
        this.applyTemplateToSection(section, resolvedTemplate)
      )
    );
    
    // Generate table of contents
    const toc = this.generateTOC(content.sections, resolvedTemplate);
    
    // Generate bookmarks
    const bookmarks = this.generateBookmarks(content.sections);
    
    return {
      template: resolvedTemplate,
      sections: processedSections,
      toc,
      bookmarks,
      metadata: content.metadata
    };
  }
  
  private applyTemplateToSection(
    section: ContentSection,
    template: TemplateConfig
  ): ProcessedSection {
    return {
      ...section,
      html: this.styleEngine.render(section.content, {
        typography: template.typography,
        colors: template.colors,
        elements: template.elements,
        customStyles: section.customStyles
      }),
      layout: this.calculateLayout(section, template)
    };
  }
  
  private generateTOC(
    sections: ContentSection[],
    template: TemplateConfig
  ): TableOfContents {
    const entries = sections
      .filter(s => s.level <= 3)
      .map(s => ({
        title: s.title,
        level: s.level,
        page: 0, // Calculated during pagination
        sectionId: s.id
      }));
    
    return {
      title: 'Table of Contents',
      entries,
      style: template.elements.toc
    };
  }
}
```

### Bước 3: Layout Calculation

```typescript
// Calculate page layouts với pagination
interface LayoutResult {
  pages: Page[];
  tableOfContents: TOCPage;
  bookmarks: Bookmark[];
}

class LayoutEngine {
  private pageWidth: number;
  private pageHeight: number;
  private margins: Margins;
  
  constructor(config: PageConfig) {
    this.pageWidth = this.mmToPoints(config.width);
    this.pageHeight = this.mmToPoints(config.height);
    this.margins = config.margins;
  }
  
  calculateLayout(processed: ProcessedTemplate): LayoutResult {
    const pages: Page[] = [];
    let currentPage = this.createNewPage(1);
    let currentY = this.margins.top;
    
    // Add first page as TOC
    const tocPage = this.renderTOC(processed.toc);
    pages.push(tocPage);
    currentY = tocPage.endY;
    
    // Process each section
    for (const section of processed.sections) {
      const sectionHeight = this.estimateSectionHeight(section);
      
      // Check if section fits on current page
      if (currentY + sectionHeight > this.pageHeight - this.margins.bottom) {
        // Start new page
        pages.push(currentPage);
        currentPage = this.createNewPage(pages.length + 1);
        currentY = this.margins.top;
      }
      
      // Add section to current page
      const rendered = this.renderSection(section, currentPage, currentY);
      currentPage.elements.push(...rendered.elements);
      currentY = rendered.endY;
      
      // Handle page breaks within section
      while (rendered.remainingContent.length > 0) {
        pages.push(currentPage);
        currentPage = this.createNewPage(pages.length + 1);
        currentY = this.margins.top;
        
        const continuation = this.renderContinuation(
          rendered.remainingContent,
          currentPage,
          currentY
        );
        currentPage.elements.push(...continuation.elements);
        currentY = continuation.endY;
      }
    }
    
    // Add last page if not empty
    if (currentPage.elements.length > 0) {
      pages.push(currentPage);
    }
    
    return {
      pages: this.numberPages(pages),
      tableOfContents: tocPage,
      bookmarks: this.extractBookmarks(processed.sections)
    };
  }
  
  private createNewPage(pageNumber: number): Page {
    return {
      number: pageNumber,
      width: this.pageWidth,
      height: this.pageHeight,
      margins: this.margins,
      elements: [],
      background: null
    };
  }
  
  private estimateSectionHeight(section: ProcessedSection): number {
    let height = 0;
    
    // Heading height
    height += this.getHeadingHeight(section.level);
    
    // Content height
    const lines = section.html.split('\n').length;
    height += lines * this.getLineHeight();
    
    // Code blocks
    height += section.codeBlocks.reduce((sum, block) => 
      sum + this.estimateCodeBlockHeight(block), 0
    );
    
    // Tables
    height += section.tables.reduce((sum, table) => 
      sum + this.estimateTableHeight(table), 0
    );
    
    return height;
  }
}
```

### Bước 4: PDF Rendering

```typescript
// Render layout to PDF
class PDFRenderer {
  private pdfLib: PDFDocument;
  private fontRegistry: FontRegistry;
  
  async render(layout: LayoutResult, config: RenderConfig): Promise<Buffer> {
    this.pdfLib = await PDFDocument.create();
    this.pdfLib.setTitle(config.title);
    this.pdfLib.setAuthor(config.author);
    this.pdfLib.setSubject(config.subject);
    
    // Embed fonts
    await this.embedFonts(config.fonts);
    
    // Render each page
    for (const page of layout.pages) {
      const pdfPage = this.pdfLib.addPage([page.width, page.height]);
      
      // Set page background
      if (page.background) {
        this.setPageBackground(pdfPage, page.background);
      }
      
      // Render elements
      for (const element of page.elements) {
        await this.renderElement(pdfPage, element);
      }
      
      // Add page number
      if (config.showPageNumbers) {
        this.addPageNumber(pdfPage, page.number, config.pageNumberFormat);
      }
      
      // Add header/footer
      if (config.showHeader) {
        this.addHeader(pdfPage, layout);
      }
      if (config.showFooter) {
        this.addFooter(pdfPage, page.number, layout);
      }
    }
    
    // Add bookmarks
    this.addBookmarks(layout.bookmarks);
    
    // Add table of contents entries
    this.addTOCEntries(layout.tableOfContents);
    
    // Optimize and compress
    const pdfBytes = await this.pdfLib.save();
    return this.optimize(pdfBytes, config.compression);
  }
  
  private async renderElement(page: PDFPage, element: Element): Promise<void> {
    switch (element.type) {
      case 'text':
        await this.renderText(page, element);
        break;
      case 'heading':
        await this.renderHeading(page, element);
        break;
      case 'code':
        await this.renderCodeBlock(page, element);
        break;
      case 'table':
        await this.renderTable(page, element);
        break;
      case 'image':
        await this.renderImage(page, element);
        break;
      case 'list':
        await this.renderList(page, element);
        break;
    }
  }
  
  private async renderCodeBlock(page: PDFPage, element: CodeElement): Promise<void> {
    const codeFont = await this.fontRegistry.get('monospace');
    
    // Draw background
    page.drawRectangle({
      x: element.x,
      y: element.y,
      width: element.width,
      height: element.height,
      color: this.hexToRGB('#f5f5f5'),
      borderColor: this.hexToRGB('#e0e0e0'),
      borderWidth: 1
    });
    
    // Draw code
    const lines = this.wrapCode(element.code, element.width - 20);
    
    let y = element.y + element.height - 15;
    for (const line of lines) {
      page.drawText(line, {
        x: element.x + 10,
        y,
        size: 9,
        font: codeFont,
        color: this.hexToRGB('#333333')
      });
      y -= 12;
    }
    
    // Draw language label if specified
    if (element.language) {
      page.drawText(element.language, {
        x: element.x + element.width - 50,
        y: element.y + element.height - 12,
        size: 8,
        font: codeFont,
        color: this.hexToRGB('#666666')
      });
    }
  }
  
  private async renderTable(page: PDFPage, element: TableElement): Promise<void> {
    const { table, startX, startY } = element;
    
    // Draw header row
    let y = startY;
    let x = startX;
    
    const headerHeight = 25;
    page.drawRectangle({
      x, y: y - headerHeight,
      width: element.width,
      height: headerHeight,
      color: this.hexToRGB('#2c3e50')
    });
    
    for (const cell of table.headers) {
      page.drawText(cell, {
        x: x + 5,
        y: y - 17,
        size: 10,
        font: await this.fontRegistry.get('bold'),
        color: this.hexToRGB('#ffffff')
      });
      x += cell.width;
    }
    
    // Draw data rows
    for (const row of table.rows) {
      y -= headerHeight;
      x = startX;
      
      const rowBg = y % 2 === 0 ? '#ffffff' : '#f9f9f9';
      page.drawRectangle({
        x, y: y - 20,
        width: element.width,
        height: 20,
        color: this.hexToRGB(rowBg)
      });
      
      for (const cell of row) {
        page.drawText(cell, {
          x: x + 5,
          y: y - 14,
          size: 9,
          font: await this.fontRegistry.get('regular'),
          color: this.hexToRGB('#333333')
        });
        x += cell.width;
      }
    }
    
    // Draw borders
    this.drawTableBorders(page, element);
  }
}
```

### Bước 5: Advanced Features

```typescript
// Support advanced PDF features
class AdvancedPDFFeatures {
  // Add watermarks
  async addWatermark(
    pdf: Buffer,
    watermark: WatermarkConfig
  ): Promise<Buffer> {
    const doc = await PDFDocument.load(pdf);
    const pages = doc.getPages();
    
    const watermarkImage = await this.createWatermarkImage(watermark);
    
    for (const page of pages) {
      page.drawImage(watermarkImage, {
        x: page.getWidth() / 2 - watermarkImage.width / 2,
        y: page.getHeight() / 2 - watermarkImage.height / 2,
        opacity: watermark.opacity
      });
    }
    
    return await doc.save();
  }
  
  // Add digital signature
  async addSignature(
    pdf: Buffer,
    signature: SignatureConfig
  ): Promise<Buffer> {
    const doc = await PDFDocument.load(pdf);
    const lastPage = doc.getPages()[doc.getPages().length - 1];
    
    // Draw signature line
    lastPage.drawLine({
      start: { x: 50, y: 100 },
      end: { x: 250, y: 100 },
      thickness: 1,
      color: rgb(0, 0, 0)
    });
    
    // Add signature image
    const signatureImage = await doc.embedPng(signature.imageBuffer);
    lastPage.drawImage(signatureImage, {
      x: 50,
      y: 60,
      width: 150,
      height: 40
    });
    
    // Add timestamp
    lastPage.drawText(`Signed: ${signature.timestamp}`, {
      x: 50,
      y: 45,
      size: 8
    });
    
    return await doc.save();
  }
  
  // Create PDF/A for archival
  async createPDFA(
    content: ParsedContent,
    config: PDFAConfig
  ): Promise<Buffer> {
    const doc = await PDFDocument.create({ 
      format: 'pdf/a-1a',
      compliance: 'PDF/A-1a'
    });
    
    // Embed fonts with metadata
    await this.embedFontsPDFA(doc, config.fonts);
    
    // Add XMP metadata
    doc.setXMPMetadata({
      title: config.title,
      creator: config.author,
      date: new Date().toISOString(),
      format: 'application/pdf'
    });
    
    // Render content
    await this.renderContent(doc, content);
    
    return await doc.save({ 
      useObjectStreams: false 
    });
  }
}
```

